3. Specifications & Limitations

  - File Size Limit: Must be under 3 MB. Files exceeding 3 MB are ignored completely.
  - Base Branch Context: Evaluated on the target branch of the PR, allowing different branches to maintain separate ownership definitions.
  - Unsupported Gitignore Features: Pattern negation (!), escaping comments (\#), and character range brackets ([ ]) are not supported.
  - Case Sensitivity: Path matching is case-sensitive.

