  - Extension matching: *.js @js-team
  - Email matching: *.go build-team@example.com
  - Organization team: *.txt @org-name/writers
  - Root-relative directory: /docs/ @doc-team
  - Wildcard directory: **/logs @ops-team
  - Unsetting ownership: /apps/public/ (leaving a subdirectory with no owner assigned)

5. Branch Protection & Security

  - Enforcing Approvals: Enable "Require review from Code Owners" under Branch Protection Rules or Rulesets to block PR merges until an owner approves.
  - Approval Threshold: Approval from any single owner listed on a matching line satisfies the requirement for those files.
  - Securing Configuration: Protect the configuration file itself by defining explicit owners: /.github/grubhub @repo-admin
